{"page":196,"width":1812,"height":2824,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"250 Chapter 5 CPU 스케줄링","words":[{"text":"250","x":180,"y":141,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"Chapter","x":324,"y":144,"width":133,"height":32},{"text":"5","x":472,"y":147,"width":24,"height":24},{"text":"CPU","x":529,"y":149,"width":59,"height":26},{"text":"스케줄링","x":598,"y":147,"width":96,"height":28}]},{"text":"5.6 실시간 CPU 스케줄렁! Rea1-Time CPU scheduling","words":[{"text":"5.6","x":181,"y":287,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"실시간","x":327,"y":284,"width":125,"height":46},{"text":"CPU","x":466,"y":287,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"스케줄렁!","x":576,"y":285,"width":156,"height":47},{"text":"Rea1-Time","x":766,"y":294,"width":189,"height":29},{"text":"CPU","x":969,"y":294,"width":85,"height":28},{"text":"scheduling","x":1065,"y":294,"width":216,"height":36}]},{"text":"실시간 운영체제에서 CPU를 스케줄링 할 때는 특별한 쟁점을 고려해야 한다. 일반적","words":[{"text":"실시간","x":328,"y":387,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"운영체제에서","x":449,"y":389,"width":205,"height":40},{"text":"CPU를","x":674,"y":389,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"스케줄링","x":807,"y":384,"width":132,"height":42},{"text":"할","x":961,"y":385,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"때는","x":1013,"y":385,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"특별한","x":1097,"y":385,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"쟁점을","x":1221,"y":385,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"고려해야","x":1344,"y":385,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":1509,"y":385,"width":82,"height":39},{"text":"일반적","x":1615,"y":386,"width":94,"height":45}]},{"text":"으로 연성(soft) 실시간 시스템과 경성(hard) 실시간 시스템으로 구분한다. 연성 실시","words":[{"text":"으로","x":327,"y":456,"width":71,"height":31},{"text":"연성(soft)","x":418,"y":454,"width":158,"height":44},{"text":"실시간","x":597,"y":454,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"시스템과","x":717,"y":452,"width":135,"height":41},{"text":"경성(hard)","x":870,"y":451,"width":172,"height":44},{"text":"실시간","x":1063,"y":450,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"시스템으로","x":1185,"y":449,"width":175,"height":42},{"text":"구분한다.","x":1378,"y":449,"width":156,"height":41},{"text":"연성","x":1559,"y":450,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"실시","x":1649,"y":452,"width":60,"height":43}]},{"text":"간 시스템은 중요한 실시간 프로세스가 스게줄 되는 시점에 관해 아무런 보장을 하지 않","words":[{"text":"간","x":329,"y":521,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"시스템은","x":378,"y":520,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"중요한","x":529,"y":521,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"실시간","x":648,"y":519,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스가","x":762,"y":517,"width":171,"height":41},{"text":"스게줄","x":945,"y":517,"width":103,"height":41},{"text":"되는","x":1062,"y":517,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"시점에","x":1146,"y":516,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"관해","x":1262,"y":514,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"아무런","x":1347,"y":515,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"보장을","x":1471,"y":514,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"하지","x":1598,"y":515,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"않","x":1682,"y":520,"width":30,"height":40}]},{"text":"는다. 연성 실시간 시스템은 오직 중요 프로세스가 그렇지 않은 프로세스들에 비해 우선","words":[{"text":"는다.","x":328,"y":586,"width":79,"height":40},{"text":"연성","x":425,"y":585,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"실시간","x":507,"y":585,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"시스템은","x":624,"y":585,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"오직","x":772,"y":584,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"중요","x":853,"y":586,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":935,"y":583,"width":173,"height":40},{"text":"그렇지","x":1120,"y":582,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"않은","x":1240,"y":582,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스들에","x":1323,"y":579,"width":218,"height":40},{"text":"비해","x":1561,"y":580,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"우선","x":1646,"y":582,"width":64,"height":42}]},{"text":"권을 가진다는 것만 보장한다. 경성 실시간 시스템은 더 엄격한 요구 조건을 만족시켜야","words":[{"text":"권을","x":331,"y":653,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"가진다는","x":414,"y":651,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"것만","x":567,"y":651,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"보장한다.","x":646,"y":651,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"경성","x":808,"y":651,"width":62,"heigh