51,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"경성","x":414,"y":850,"width":62,"height":40},{"text":"실시간","x":493,"y":849,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"운영체제에서","x":605,"y":848,"width":198,"height":41},{"text":"프로세스","x":819,"y":847,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"스케줄링과","x":964,"y":846,"width":173,"height":41},{"text":"관련된","x":1147,"y":846,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"여러","x":1267,"y":845,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"쟁점에","x":1350,"y":843,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"대해","x":1471,"y":842,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"논의한다.","x":1556,"y":843,"width":148,"height":42}]},{"text":"5.6.1 지연시간 최소화 Minimizing Latency","words":[{"text":"5.6.1","x":331,"y":975,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"지연시간","x":496,"y":973,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"최소화","x":634,"y":973,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"Minimizing","x":755,"y":980,"width":164,"height":30},{"text":"Latency","x":930,"y":980,"width":128,"height":28}]},{"text":"실시간 시스템의 이벤트-중심의 특성을 생각해 보자. 시스템은 일반적으로 실시간으로","words":[{"text":"실시간","x":332,"y":1054,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"시스템의","x":450,"y":1054,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"이벤트-중심의","x":602,"y":1054,"width":228,"height":40},{"text":"특성을","x":847,"y":1053,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"생각해","x":964,"y":1051,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"보자.","x":1081,"y":1050,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"시스템은","x":1177,"y":1049,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"일반적으로","x":1337,"y":1047,"width":181,"height":40},{"text":"실시간으로","x":1536,"y":1046,"width":176,"height":41}]},{"text":"발생하는 이벤트를 기다린다. 이벤트는 타이머가 만료되었을 때처럼 소프트웨어적으로","words":[{"text":"발생하는","x":331,"y":1120,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"이벤트를","x":487,"y":1120,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"기다린다.","x":638,"y":1120,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"이벤트는","x":799,"y":1120,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"타이머가","x":949,"y":1117,"width":139,"height":41},{"text":"만료되었을","x":1104,"y":1115,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"때처럼","x":1297,"y":1113,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"소프트웨어적으로","x":1421,"y":1113,"width":291,"height":39}]},{"text":"발생하기도 하고, 원격으로 제어되던 장치가 방해물을 만났을 때와 같이 하드웨어적으로","words":[{"text":"발생하기도","x":331,"y":1185,"width":172,"height":41},{"text":"하고,","x":515,"y":1186,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"원격으로","x":606,"y":1186,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"제어되던","x":753,"y":1185,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"장치가","x":900,"y":1184,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"방해물을","x":1016,"y":1181,"width":139,"height":41},{"text":"만났을","x":1168,"y":1180,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"때와","x":1288,"y":1179,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"같이","x":1372,"y":1178,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"하드웨어적으로","x":1458,"y":1178,"width":254,"height":39}]},{"text":"발생하기도 한다. 이벤트가 발생하면, 시스템은 기능한 빨리 그에 응답을 하고 그에 맞는","words":[{"text":"발생하기도","x":330,"y":1250,"width":172,"height":41},{"text":"한다.","x":513,"y":1252,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"이벤트가","x":605,"y":1250,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"발생하면,","x":752,"y":1250,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"시스템은","x":910,"y":1249,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"기능한","x":1061,"y":1247,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"빨리","x":1178,"y":1245,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"그에","x":1261,"y":1245,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"응답을","x":1344,"y":1244,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"하고","x":1469,"y":1244,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"그에","x":1558,"y":1243,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"맞는","x":1646,"y":1242,"width":66,"height":40}]},{"text":"동작을 수행하여야 한다. 이벤트 지연시간은 이벤트가 발생해서 그에 맞는 서비스가 수","words":[{"text":"동작을","x":328,"y":1316,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"수행하여야","x":446,"y":1316,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":630,"y":1316,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"이벤트","x":724,"y":1316,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"지연시간은","x":840,"y":1315,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"이벤트가","x":1027,"y":1312,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"발생해서","x":1181,"y":1310,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"그에","x":1337,"y":1309,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"맞는","x":1427,"y":1309,"width":75,"height":39},{